        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF152 supports the <code class=\"notranslate\">SVGTextPathElement.side</code> property in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2034371\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2034371</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is non-standard, but agreed to be standardized - see <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4215191475\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/svgwg/issues/1086\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/svgwg/issues/1086/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/svgwg/issues/1086\">w3c/svgwg#1086</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note it is only supported in Firefox - the corresponding <code class=\"notranslate\">size</code> attribute on the SVG <code class=\"notranslate\">textPath</code> is only implemented in FF and that is already in BCD.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4469279461\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44162\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44162/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44162\">mdn/content#44162</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29778",
            "title": "FF152 SVGTextPathElement.side",
            "date_modified": "2026-06-01T06:59:25.000Z",
