        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update to reflect that <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2034168\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 2034168</a> including a change so that<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">extension.isAllowedFileSchemeAccess()</code> reflects the value of the \"Access local files on your computer\" option in the extension's permissions settings.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Four related content changes see PR TBC.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29776",
            "title": "Bug 2034168 extension.isAllowedFileSchemeAccess reflects file access permission",
