        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1152698?u=5ce323090a48b425ec70128365c96809699959f7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Marking the Translator and LanguageDetector APIs as supported in Edge 148.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tested <a href=\"https://microsoftedge.github.io/Demos/built-in-ai/playgrounds/translator-api/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://microsoftedge.github.io/Demos/built-in-ai/playgrounds/translator-api/</a> and <a href=\"https://microsoftedge.github.io/Demos/built-in-ai/playgrounds/languagedetector-api/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://microsoftedge.github.io/Demos/built-in-ai/playgrounds/languagedetector-api/</a> in Edge Version 148.0.3967.83 (Official build) (arm64) on Windows 11.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/web-platform/translator-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/web-platform/translator-api</a> and <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/web-platform/languagedetector-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/web-platform/languagedetector-api</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29775",
            "title": "Translator and LanguageDetector APIs are in Edge 148",
            "date_modified": "2026-06-01T07:12:15.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-31T12:14:08.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "captainbrosset",
                "url": "https://github.com/captainbrosset"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update the expected version number for Chrome and link to the Firefox bug for CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">url()</code> request modifiers.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I was tipped off to this by the Chromium engineer, in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4214051830\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3930\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3930/hovercard?comment_id=4543191391&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3930#issuecomment-4543191391\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3930 (comment)</a>.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5111997147512832\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chrome status entry: CSS URL request modifiers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2038424\" title=\"[css-values] Implement url request modifiers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox bug 2038424</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4214051830\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3930\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3930/hovercard?comment_id=4543191391&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3930#issuecomment-4543191391\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3930 (comment)</a></li>\n<li>Previously:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4430427293\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29663\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29663/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29663\">#29663</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4233563538\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29440\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29440/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29440\">#29440</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n",
